      "type": "p",
      "text": "KTM Duke 390 vs KTM Duke 250 Comparison A big dilemma for bike lovers in India is to choose between KTM Duke 390 and KTM Duke 250. Both motorcycles share aggressive styling, premium hardware and KTM’s famous streetfighter DNA but they cater for different types of rider."
    },
