      "type": "p",
      "text": "The Duke 250 is a good all-round, affordable package, while the Duke 390 is designed for riders who want thrilling acceleration and top-end electronics."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "**So which one is worth your money in 2026?**"
    },
