      "type": "callout",
      "text": "**Quick verdict:** The Duke 390 is the better motorcycle, but the Duke 250 is the smarter buy for most riders. Pick the 390 if you ride highways often and want maximum performance and electronics; pick the 250 if you mostly ride in the city, want lower running costs, and prefer to save roughly ₹65,000 or more."
    },
